Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=10}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.93,0:02:00.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely no way we'll make\Nit to the Grand Line in this condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:04.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, ZORO] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right, we're gonna need\Na whole lot more meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:10.44,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Eating fruit\Nevery day is for the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll also need\Nsome booze. [grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.61,0:02:15.11,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Shut up,\Nyou boneheads! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.53,0:02:17.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:19.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line's a dangerous place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:22.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll need more than beer\Nand meat to survive there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the place\Nis crawling with pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:25.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who are also in search\Nof the One Piece,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they all have ships\Nthat are way better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:29.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we don't have a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:32.26,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] We don't have a crew,\Nwe don't have any equipment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:33.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or even a real ship\Nfor that matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:36.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is no way\Nwe'll ever make it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:40.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep, we'll need a cook and maybe\Na musician to keep us entertained.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A musician? [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:46.23,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] So... stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:50.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A little to the south of here is\Nan island with some settlements on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:52.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it looks like we might be\Nable to get our ship
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and some of the supplies\Nwe need there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fresh meat at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:57.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And lots of booze, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:03.00,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Sound the alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:03.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're here and they're\Ngonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:07.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:10.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates! Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:12.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:13.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:15.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everybody run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:17.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates! Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:19.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:24.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Their bloodlust is unquenchable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... we're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:30.57,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] The pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:33.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are a...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:37.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.24,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You little liar! You're not\Ngonna get away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:50.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:57.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:04:00.51,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Just try\Nand catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– C'mon, slowpokes! [laughs]\N– [VILLAGERS yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, man! Looks\Nlike he got away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That kid's a no good troublemaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:13.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'd better hope\NI never get a hold of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:17.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like nobody's getting\Na hold of him today. Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:22.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:27.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Yet another job well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is my solemn duty to send
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the wind of excitement\Nthrough this boring, old village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.09,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:35.80,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!\NWhat's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:40.05,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] I bid you\Ngood morning, Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:43.43,Main-207-,,0,0,1,,Fear not! Your loyal crew,\Nthe Usopp Pirates, have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:45.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:48.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pepper, Carrot. It's just\Nyou two? Where's Onion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you seen him\Naround today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONION screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:53.86,Main-207-,All,0,0,0,,[ALL] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:55.11,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Sound the alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're here! They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:05:00.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're here and they're gonna\Nkill us all! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:01.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder what\Nhe's freaking out about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pirates! Pirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Run for your lives! Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bloodthirsty murderers have\Nlanded! Run, everybody, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:12.71,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\an8}[USOPP] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:17.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONION panting] I'm\Nnot playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:20.09,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Eh... It's for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.09,0:05:22.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's for real!\NPirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:24.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gah! Gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um... time for me\Nto have my snack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:27.31,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] You chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:30.48,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Actually,\NI'm sick! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:34.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have, "I'll-die-if-I-\Ndon't-eat-my-snackiosis".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:36.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEPPER, ONION] You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:39.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You always told us that you\Nwanted to become real pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,someday, and now's\Nour chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.20,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Yeah!\NWhat's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of a pirate is\Nafraid of other pirates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:48.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly, it was\NBuggy the Clown's mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:52.42,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] B...\NBuggy the Clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:56.00,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Uh...\NI think I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:58.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I only saw two tiny boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there were\Njust three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's go time,\NBrave Usopp Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:08.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We do have a village\Nto protect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:09.14,Secondary-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,{\an8}[KIDS] Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:09.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go, men! Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:12.44,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Uh... Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.53,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:25.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Feels good to be\Non dry land again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.24,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] There's a village\Nsomewhere around here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:31.16,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Yeah... It looks\Nlike small one, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:33.12,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Ooh! Ooh!\NThen, there's meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:36.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There has to be a place\Nto eat meat in this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just forget about meat\Nfor a minute, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:41.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[rustling]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.80,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Careful...\Nwe're being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? By who? Where\Nare they? They got meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:47.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:03.07,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Ohh! That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.69,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this supposed to be\Nwhen we're impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:06.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughing] I am Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:09.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leader of the invincible nation\Nof pirates who reign over this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You stand before a living legend,\Nthe most revered pirate who ever lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:15.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the Great Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:16.96,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:17.83,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:21.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Surely you know that plotting an attack\Non this island would mean certain death!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}My army of eighty million super-mean\Npirate soldiers would squash you like bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:29.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:30.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:33.93,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] You expect\Nus to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:35.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! She knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:38.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep! Well, now I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:40.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could I have\Nbeen so dumb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:41.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I practically told her\NI was lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:43.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:45.24,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:48.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! He was lying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:49.70,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Curse you,\Nyou crafty tactician!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eighty million may have been\Nan exaggeration,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:55.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,184)}but I have a great many men\Nunder my control!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:08:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KIDS whimper]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:03.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My guess is {\i1}three{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:07.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KIDS screaming] She\Ndoes know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:09.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screaming continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where're you guys\Ngoing? Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:19.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing] That's pretty cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth\Nor I'll shut it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:24.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a proud man\Nand I won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:28.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is your last warning,\Nor you'll get to see why they call me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:33.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Proud Usopp",\Nand not "Pushover Usopp".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:35.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've already seen for yourself just\Nhow good I am with this thing, so,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:41.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you know I could rival\Nanyone carrying a pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that you've drawn your pistol,\Nare you willing... to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:54.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:56.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guns aren't for threats,\Nthey're for actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:58.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you willing\Nto risk your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:01.56,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Guns aren't\Nfor threats, they're for actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:10.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you willing\Nto risk your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gah. Real pirates definitely\Nhave a lot more punch
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:19.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,behind their words, 'cause\Nthey can actually back 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's so cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:28.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I stole that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.76,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:33.21,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LUFFY] I stole those words from\NRed Haired Shanks, a pirate I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:37.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know Red Haired Shanks?\NYou really are a real pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:40.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, you gotta be lying,\Ndo you really know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep! I know your dad too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:43.69,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:44.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}His name's Yasopp, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:49.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs, yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:51.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:54.28,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Uh... You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:57.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My old man's name is Yasopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:59.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:01.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How in the world\Ndo you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:12.80,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] This is good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:16.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, I met your dad\Nwhen I was just a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, does my old man\Nreally know Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:22.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Know him?! When I met your dad\Nhe was a part of Shanks's crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:24.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so they were probably\Npretty good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:25.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:29.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My old man, sailing\Nthe high seas with famous pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.32,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LUFFY] I haven't heard from him\Nin a while, but I'll bet he's still with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:36.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was a heck\Nof a sharpshooter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd keep him on my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:56.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Good shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.64,0:11:01.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Eh, that's nothing, I could shoot an ant\Nbetween the eyes from across town!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:04.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.35,Flashbacks-207-,Yasopp,0,0,0,,[YASOPP] Ah! You know\Nsomething, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:11.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I got a kid named Usopp,\Nand he's just about your age!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:12.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You told me\Nabout him already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:13.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.65,0:11:16.70,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:18.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:20.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tellin' ya again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:23.20,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It broke my heart to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:26.25,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But I had to go.\NYou see, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:29.63,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,When the pirate flag beckons,\Nyou must heed it's call!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:34.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheer]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:38.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:42.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He used to go on and on\Nand on about his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:45.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I heard enough about you\Nto make my ears bleed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.06,0:11:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And lemme tell you,\Nhe was a great pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:51.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sure am proud\Nof my old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:55.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He leapt into a pirate's life\Non the endless sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:58.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And chose a life\Nof real adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:12:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:03.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know someone who could\Nprovide us with a decent ship;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or even anyone who knows\Nhow to sail for that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:09.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sighs] Well, it's\Na pretty small village...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:12.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I just don't think\Nwe'll be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:14.17,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] What about that huge mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The one on top\Nof that hill over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.05,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\an8}[USOPP] Ee!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Do you know\Nthem, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With all that money, surely\Nthey could help us get our boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stay away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:24.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, LUFFY, ZORO] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:26.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gah! Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:29.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just remembered something\Nthat I really gotta do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Everybody knows me at this place. So,\Nuh, stay and eat as much as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:37.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:42.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why was he in such a hurry\Nto get outta here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:48.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is\Nthe place they took him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:50.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those terrible pirates\Ndragged him inside
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:51.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and now it's up to us\Nto save our captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, guys, those're\Nreal pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:55.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What if they've grilled\Nand eaten him already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:55.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:58.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's grisly old witch hags who\Neat their victims, not pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be the most brutal\Nand epic battle of our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we must show no mercy\Nbecause they will never show it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:04.85,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Hm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:09.31,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] The Usopp pirates,\Nhave arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:10.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who're these kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Usopp is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:13.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did they...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:15.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fess up, you filthy pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:17.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What have you done\Nwith our beloved Captain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:18.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:20.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONION, CARROT] Yeah!\NTell us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:23.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY sighs] That meat\Nsure was good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:24.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [KIDS gasp]\N– What meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:26.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These pirates are cannibals!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:30.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What have you done,\Nyou savages?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:33.13,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] If you're looking\Nfor your captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.63,0:13:36.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we ate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.55,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Wah! Cannibals!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:42.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What are you punks\Nlooking at me for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, ZORO laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:47.64,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] You just had to say\Nsomething stupid, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.86,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] You wish\Nto see Usopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't start this, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:04.99,Main-207-,,0,0,15,,May I see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:06.49,Main-207-,,0,0,15,,I like talking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:09.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs] No, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:12.12,Main-207-,,0,0,15,,That man is, without a doubt,\Na chronic liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For someone in your weakened state,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:17.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp's outlandish stories\Nmight be too much to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:20.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your late parents instructed\Nme to protect you to the fullest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:25.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}of my abilities. It would be against their\Nwishes for you to see him, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.89,0:14:28.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll leave\Nyour medicine right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:30.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please be sure to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:35.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Killjoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.44,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] "Killjoy" will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A name I'll bear,\Nif you are kept safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:44.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [KAYA whimpers]\N– [doors clatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:51.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp! You came!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! How are you?\NYou seem a little down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:56.50,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:59.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of talking like this, I'd like\Nto invite inside like a proper guest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but there's just no way\NKlahadore would ever allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:05.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not a bad person, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:10.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Remember, I'm a brave warrior of the sea,\Nwho likes endless oceans and the open sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:12.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Houses weren't made\Nfor rogues like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:15.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd probably just feel\Ncramped in there. [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.44,0:15:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what adventure are you\Ngoing to tell me about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:21.19,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Hmm.\NWell, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What about the story of me\Nfighting a giant goldfish
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:26.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at the south pole, when I was\Nonly five years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.91,0:15:27.99,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] A goldfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:29.83,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] A giant goldfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What first astounded me was\Nthe immense size of it's poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:36.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was so big that when I landed\Non it, I thought it was solid ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:37.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looked like an island!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, KAYA laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:55.14,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Whoa!\NThis place is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:57.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And If our captain\Nran off at this hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:58.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then this is the place\Nhe's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:01.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... What in the world\Ndoes Usopp come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:03.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He comes to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:05.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To lie? That's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.20,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] He's not a bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's great! Isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:09.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! He's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How is a liar awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:15.04,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Well, Kaya,\Nthe girl who lives there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:17.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,has been in a terrible\Ndepression that's kept
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:19.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,her weak and in bed\Nsince her parents got sick
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and died a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:26.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}She's very rich, but all that money couldn't\Nhelp her recover from her sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:30.93,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ONION] So our captain tells his special made-up\Nstories to make her laugh and cheer her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:34.06,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Captain Usopp is\Nthe best at telling lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:39.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, that really is\Npretty nice of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:40.56,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:44.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The best thing about him is his mischievous side,\Nhe's always up to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I like him 'cause he's not\Nafraid to be silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:49.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I like the Captain's crazy lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:52.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So when he tells her those stories,\Nhe makes her feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:54.03,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Yep! Lots better!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:58.33,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Great! I think\Nwe should ask her for a ship after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:00.46,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Getting\Nin is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:02.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those guards at the gate\Ndon't let anyone through!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:05.05,Main-207-,All,0,0,0,,– [ALL] Uhh...\N– [CARROT] Where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:06.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– I'll go ask her!\N– [ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:08.38,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] No!\NYou're not gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pardon the intrusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.06,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] N... No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:20.14,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}– [LUFFY] Rocket!\N– [ALL yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:23.23,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] So after that terrifying\Nand traumatic little incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:28.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we escaped into the sky riding\Non a giant slingshot ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:29.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:30.99,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Hm? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.99,0:17:32.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:41.08,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] That worked well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:43.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My goodness, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:46.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... Don't mind them Kaya,\Nthis happens to me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:48.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's just the price of being\Na famous adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:52.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They're just new recruits who heard about me\Nand came to join the Usopp pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope, not me.\NI came here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.14,0:17:56.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:58.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A favor? From me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:17:59.39,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:00.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was wondering\Nif there was any way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:03.98,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,– you could help us get a boat.\N– [KLAHADORE] You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:06.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think\Nyou're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:10.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:12.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that this is\Ncriminal trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,these people are
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:24.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not now, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:27.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about this\Nriff-raff after they've left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now get out! All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:32.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave now, unless you have\Nsome business with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:36.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright! Do you think that\Nyou could help us get a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.64,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] Certainly not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:38.47,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Aww...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:39.47,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.47,0:18:40.27,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:43.06,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] You have\Nquite the reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:45.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are very well known\Nin the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:48.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive\Nfor someone as young as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usually, people who admire\Nme so much, call me Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:53.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, it's Captain Usopp to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:56.78,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] Your father also\Nhad something of a reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:19:01.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll never be anything more\Nthan the son of a filthy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:05.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows what sort\Nof trouble you're up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:10.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}All I ask is that you and your kind leave\Nthis respectable young lady alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A filthy pirate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.05,0:19:16.84,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KLAHADORE] You and she are\Nfrom completely different worlds and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:19.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it money you're after?\NHow much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.26,0:19:21.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cease this at once, Klahadore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:23.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Apologize to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:25.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:29.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I don't believe there is any reason\Nto apologize to this savage young man, My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:30.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.40,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] My goal\Nisn't to slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am merely stating the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:36.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sympathize\Nwith your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.61,0:19:39.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must hate your\Ngreat, idiot of a father
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}for abandoning his family and his village\Nbecause of his mindless lust for treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:44.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:48.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare insult\Nmy father ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:52.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [USOPP grunts]\N– [KAYA gasps] Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:53.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAYA gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:55.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:19:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:02.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why have you gotten\Nso worked up, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's times like these when you\Nshould do what you do best and lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:08.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me about how your father\Nis really a traveling salesman,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:11.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or about how you aren't\Nreally related by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:12.86,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.11,0:20:15.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAYA gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:16.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:22.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:24.12,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:27.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE grunts] Case in point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He resorts to violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:31.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess the apple never falls\Nfar from the tree, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:37.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My father listened to his heart\Nand chose a life of risk and adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.09,0:20:40.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am proud to say that my old man\Nis a brave warrior of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.55,0:20:43.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right, I have been known\Nto exaggerate from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:46.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I will never lie\Nabout who my father is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:49.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be ashamed\Nof my heritage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the son of a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEPPER, ONION whimper]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:57.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:21:01.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE laughs] Pirates\Nare brave warriors of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are they? [laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's quite a twisted way\Nof putting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:10.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You don't seem to understand that you\Nare living proof of his savage blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.67,0:21:14.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You run around spouting lies and use\Nviolence when you don't get your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:18.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To top it off, you cozy up to the lady\Nof the house to steal her fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– You're wrong! I only...\N– Your father is a filthy, no-good pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:24.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Treachery is in your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:26.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course you would hatch\Nsuch an evil scheme!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:27.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You won't let up, will you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:29.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Usopp! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:30.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:31.56,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] No more violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.56,0:21:34.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:37.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore isn't a bad person...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:38.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:43.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He's just trying to do what he thinks is best\Nfor me and sometimes he goes too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:47.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:51.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are never\Nto come here again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:53.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:55.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't have\Nto tell me twice, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:21:59.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the last you'll\Never see of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:04.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAYA whimpers] Usopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[KIDS growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.55,0:22:06.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you butler jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:08.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our Captain's not\Nthat kinda guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:09.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya stupid jerk-face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.60,0:22:11.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jerk-face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:12.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jerk-face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:15.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up. You don't have\Na bone to pick with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:16.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.69,0:22:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Put me down! Put me down!\NI'm going to kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:25.91,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] You will\Nall leave immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.71,0:22:39.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your meal is\Nready now, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.38,0:22:42.26,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] No thank you,\NI don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:46.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.22,0:22:50.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The cook would be most\Nupset to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.35,0:22:52.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He works his hardest,\Nday and night, to come up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.73,0:22:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with delicious meals\Nthat suit your needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.15,0:22:57.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[silverware clinks]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.11,0:22:57.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAYA gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:03.07,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Why were you\Nso cruel to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.07,0:23:06.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know I was wrong to talk\Nto Usopp without telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.11,0:23:10.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will admit that much, and I'm very\Nsorry for not being honest with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.20,0:23:13.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but this situation did not warrant\Nthat kind of harsh treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:18.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,May I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:20.34,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.09,0:23:25.47,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KLAHADORE] It has been quite some time\Nsince I first arrived at this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:29.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be three years that I have\Nbeen in the service of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:34.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I will never forget what happened when\NI showed up at your father's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.31,0:23:39.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAYA gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:46.20,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] My former employers\Nwere brutal, pitiless men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd been kicked off the ship I worked\Non for some small blunder I had made.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.70,0:23:53.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And with no work or money, I was\Non the verge of dying like a beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.93,0:24:11.22,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KLAHADORE] As far as I know, I\Nwould've died without your father's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.22,0:24:13.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I owe my life to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.43,0:24:18.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now that they're gone,\NI owe my life to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.15,0:24:22.65,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KLAHADORE] I know that it isn't my place\Nto interfere with your friendships.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.65,0:24:24.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have taken\Nsuch a bold step
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.28,0:24:28.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,unless I thought\Nit absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:33.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's just that Usopp isn't exactly known\Nfor his upstanding character.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.28,0:24:36.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, if anything were\Nto happen to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it would be my fault\Nfor not seeing to your safety
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.46,0:24:42.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I would never be able to ask\Nforgiveness from your parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.25,0:24:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think ill of me\Nfor my childish behavior earlier today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.46,0:24:48.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, of course I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.84,0:24:53.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm thankful to have you around too,\NKlahadore, but I stand by my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:56.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp is one of the\Nnicest people I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.68,0:24:58.31,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] We'll see\Nabout that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.31,0:25:00.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Until then, he is still\Nnot welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.60,0:25:03.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore! You blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.31,0:25:05.15,Main-207-,Klahadore,0,0,0,,[KLAHADORE] "Blockhead"\Nwill do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.36,0:25:10.66,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Hey,\NWhere'd Luffy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.28,0:25:14.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows? He probably ran\Nafter that captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.16,0:25:16.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet he's at his secret spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.83,0:25:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, over by the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.54,0:25:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He always goes there\Nwhen he's gonna think something over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.54,0:25:24.63,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Luffy can take care of himself,\Nbut where's your other friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.63,0:25:26.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEPPER, CARROT]\NOh yeah, Onion!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.50,0:25:29.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he just up\Nand disappears a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.51,0:25:32.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! And then he shows up\Noutta nowhere all freaked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.84,0:25:36.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONION screaming] Terrible news, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:37.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:40.14,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.14,0:25:43.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some nut job is on his way here\Nand he only walks backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.27,0:25:44.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEPPER, CARROT] You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.23,0:25:46.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.36,0:25:47.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.61,0:25:48.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, PEPPER, CARROT] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.62,0:25:59.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, which one of you people\Nhas the nerve to call me weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:05.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just a normal guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.71,0:26:07.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,S'that so? You look insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:09.17,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.17,0:26:11.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary, run\Nof the mill hypnotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.55,0:26:14.18,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] A hypnotist?\NReally? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.18,0:26:15.80,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Show\Nus something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.80,0:26:17.43,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Yeah!\NDo something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.47,0:26:20.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.27,0:26:23.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fools, what makes you think\Nthat I would want to reveal
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.35,0:26:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my masterful hypnosis techniques\Nto a bunch of roadside strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.19,0:26:28.69,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Okay,\Nyou convinced me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.69,0:26:30.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, watch the ring closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.28,0:26:31.32,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] What a ham!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:34.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, by the count of "Jango,"\Nyou'll be in a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.74,0:26:35.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.95,0:26:37.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KIDS gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.08,0:26:38.08,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[JANGO] One...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.08,0:26:39.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.20,0:26:39.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.50,0:26:43.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KIDS, JANGO snoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.75,0:26:45.88,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Who is\Nthis freaky weirdo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.34,0:26:51.34,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.67,0:26:53.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you doin' here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:57.10,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I came here to be alone,\Nbut I guess that's not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.10,0:26:59.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you follow me?\NWhat d'you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.18,0:27:01.27,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Oh, ya know, nothin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.64,0:27:06.48,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Oh...\NOuch... [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.57,0:27:14.45,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I can't believe\Nthat butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.45,0:27:16.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Insulting my old man like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.66,0:27:19.28,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Yeah, I hate\Nthat guy too!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.28,0:27:22.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says,\NYasopp was a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.58,0:27:23.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.71,0:27:26.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've always looked up\Nto my old man for living every day
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.46,0:27:29.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with his life on the line,\Nout in the open ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.00,0:27:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He made a brave choice\Nand I admire him for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.71,0:27:35.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then that stupid, snotty butler\Nstomped all over my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:36.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gonna pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.89,0:27:38.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.01,0:27:40.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know if you're ever\Ngonna see that girl again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.31,0:27:44.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps] I\Ndon't know. Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.10,0:27:47.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'll consider it if that butler\Napologizes to me for the things he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.98,0:27:49.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That butler right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.40,0:27:55.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... That's the one, if he... What\Nin the world is he doing down here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.11,0:27:57.32,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.32,0:27:58.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jango.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.45,0:28:01.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I specifically ordered you\Nto keep yourself inconspicuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.95,0:28:04.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean\Nsleeping in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.25,0:28:08.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Relax man, I've perfected\Nthe skills of the chameleon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.04,0:28:09.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:11.92,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] There's someone else\Nwith him and, man, is he weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.92,0:28:13.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.30,0:28:14.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.84,0:28:19.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, have all the necessary\Npreparations been made?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.05,0:28:20.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.10,0:28:29.10,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] We can start anytime...\Non the "Rich Girl Murder Plan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:31.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, USOPP gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.28,0:28:33.68,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NMurder?
